  "an3.134:0.3": "3. 3. 4. 2. ",
  "an3.134:1.1": "tisso imā bhikkhave, parisā. ",
  "an3.134:1.2": "katamā tisso? ",
  "an3.134:1.3": "ukkācitavinītā parisā, paṭipucchāvinītā parisā, yāvatāvavinītā parisā. ",
  "an3.134:1.4": "imā kho bhikkhave, tisso parisāti. ",
